    <ns0:title>1.0.0rc2: release candidate for browser-use 1.0</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Release candidate (first one published; the 1.0.0rc1 version number was unusable on PyPI). Install it explicitly. Plain &lt;code&gt;pip install browser-use&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;uv add browser-use&lt;/code&gt; still give you 0.13.14 until 1.0.0 ships. Please report problems at &lt;a href="https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use/issues"&gt;https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use/issues&lt;/a&gt; and say y</ns0:content>
