    <ns0:title>0.13.14: Python agent and integration updates</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;This release keeps the Python agent and its existing models. The Pi migration remains separate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Changes since the last PyPI release:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add OpenAI browser tools and the shared Bash helper.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve bounded page observations, form state, file access, and browser recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix temporary empty Cloud tab URLs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep screenshots, crops, and clicks aligned on</ns0:content>
