    <ns0:title>0.13.13: OpenAI browser tools and Cloud fixes</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;This release includes the OpenAI browser-tool driver and fixes two integration issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle temporary empty Cloud tab URLs during navigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep screenshots, crops, and pointer coordinates aligned on scaled displays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide 18 default browser tools and six optional actions through Browser Use Actor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support local browsers, Browser Use Cloud, and borr</ns0:content>
