    <ns0:link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use/releases/tag/0.13.12" />
    <ns0:title>0.13.12: OpenAI browser tools</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Add OpenAI browser tools backed by Browser Use Actor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Import &lt;code&gt;BrowserUse&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;browser_use.integrations.openai&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install &lt;code&gt;browser-use[openai-tools]&lt;/code&gt; to enable OpenAI Python 3.31+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use local browsers, Browser Use Cloud, or an existing connected BrowserSession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the 18 default browser tools and six optional actions.&lt;</ns0:content>
